## Recommended Next Steps

Write the policy-to-kernel alignment as two separate lemmas: original policy to prefix marginals, then \(L^\infty\) kernel to Borel implementation.

Then plug those lemmas into the existing payoff-weighted domination theorem to upgrade the no-gap result from the relaxed completed-kernel model to the original Borel private-randomized policy model.
